 "note": "Inventory the n8n maturity scorer (dimension 6) evaluates. Each mechanism names the code that implements it, the evidence source a successful runtime action leaves (kind jsonl|json|jsonstream|sqlite|journal|systemd|log|psql|absent; path relative to its base), and the success predicate: an actual heal/remediation/retry success, not merely 'ran'. PROVEN = >= min_count successes within window_hours (default dimensions.self_healing.proof_window_hours, 336 h); RAN_NOT_HEALED = records exist but too few successes; NO_EVIDENCE = no source or no records. Logs without dates trust only their last undated_tail_lines lines/records (row value, else dimensions.self_healing.undated_tail_lines) and only when the file mtime is inside the window.",
 "bases": {
  "state": "persistent state root (probe.root)",
  "repo": "repo checkout (probe.proj)",
  "devtree": "~/trade-ai-v12-rebuild/trade-ai-v12-rebuild",
  "home": "~"
 },
